  "notes": [
    "**Abrigarse** is the reflexive form of **abrigar** (to shelter/protect from cold)",
    "Regular **-AR verb** with reflexive pronouns and spelling change",
    "Spelling change: g→gu before é in preterite \"yo\" form (me abrigué)",
    "Means to dress warmly, to wrap up, to bundle up",
    "Non-reflexive **abrigar**: to keep warm, to shelter (something/someone else)",
    "Common usage: *Abrígate bien* (Bundle up well), *Me abrigo cuando hace frío* (I dress warmly when it's cold)",
    "Related noun: **el abrigo** (coat, overcoat)"
  ],
